Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 22:49:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] chore(nemesis): v0.1.0-beta.3

First release stamped past the install-script repoint: fixes the beta.2
first-boot failure (its pinned install.sh cloned the upstream repo where our
branch does not exist). Ships the consent-based home migration, Study/Anki
round (cloze, local-day caps, search, rename, undo, leech, retention), and
Library/Obsidian round (autocomplete, rename cascade, global search,
checkboxes, images).
---
 apps/desktop/package.json | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/apps/desktop/package.json b/apps/desktop/package.json
index 9fa7f119806..b28f637cef9 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/package.json
+++ b/apps/desktop/package.json
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
   "name": "nemesis",
   "productName": "Nemesis",
   "private": true,
-  "version": "0.1.0-beta.2",
+  "version": "0.1.0-beta.3",
   "description": "Native desktop shell for the Nemesis school agent.",
   "author": "Nemesis",
   "type": "module",
